+          { t: "Gaps in the team", d: "Roles nobody fills, or roles filled twice." },
+          { t: "Collaboration and friction", d: "Where styles clash and where they complement each other." },
+          { t: "Something to talk about", d: "A shared language for discussing behaviour without it becoming personal." },
+        ] },
