+          { t: "Lencioni team dynamics", d: "Maps trust, conflict, commitment, accountability and results, based on the Lencioni model." },
+          { t: "Team analysis", d: "Shows which themes in the team need attention, based on the answers of all members." },
+          { t: "360-degree feedback", d: "How colleagues, managers and clients experience someone. Adds the outside view to the self-assessment." },
+        ] },
