+          "The questionnaires rest on models from the team literature, among them the Lencioni model for team dynamics. Role preference is measured through self-assessment and is therefore strongest when you place feedback from others alongside it.",
+          "A team roles test is meant for development, not for selection. For a hiring decision you look at personality and aptitude.",
+        ], link: { label: "Read the scientific accountability", href: "/wetenschappelijke-verantwoording/" } },
